# covers: 0b 1.5, 1a 2.4
# 0b-two-clients-a: runs with 0b-two-clients-b under run-sim-multi.sh. Waits until it sees the
# other client, walks to (12, 9), stays long enough for B to observe it, then logs out (B must
# see the despawn).
#
# Timeouts (R1): the other process starts at the same time, so its login chain (15 s) is 3x'd
# to 45 s. 12 tiles take ~2 s; 15 s is generous. The 5 s pause is 30x B's interpolation delay
# (150 ms) plus a round trip.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor proxies >= 1 45
nf.ClickMove 12 9
nf.WaitFor acks >= 1 5
nf.WaitFor own_at 12 9 1 15
nf.Sleep 5
nf.Logout
nf.Within 120
